<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n116178" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὠμήλῠσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bruised meal of raw corn,</i> esp. barley or wheat (hence
			with <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κριθίνη</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυρίνη</span> added), used for poultices, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Morb.</u>
				2.31
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Nat.Mul.</u>
				27
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				10.282
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				19.156
			</span></i>; applied without water, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				12.863
			</span></i>; written divisim, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετὰ ὠμῆς λύσεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					3.24
				</span></i>
			, Arching. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				12.675
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Gp.</u>
				14.7.7
			</span></i>. (Compd. of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὠμός</span> and
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἄλῠσις</span> 'grinding',
			cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄλεσις, ἀλέω, ἄλευρον,</span> and
			foreg.; also perh. O<i><span class="en">
				E.
			</span></i>
			<i>ealu</i> 'ale':—the form <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὠμῆς
				λύσεως</span> by popular etymology: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰρῆσθαι δὲ ὅτι οὐ φρυγόμενον
					ἀλήθεται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AB</u>
					318
				</span></i>
			.)</div>
